    <briefdescription>
<para>Offload Rendering Server Plugin Implementation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This plugin implements the server-side component of <ref refid="namespaceILLIXR" kindref="compound">ILLIXR</ref>&apos;s offload rendering system. It captures rendered frames, encodes them using hardware-accelerated H.264/HEVC encoding, and sends them to a remote client for display. The system supports both color and depth frame transmission, with configurable encoding parameters.</para>
<para>Two encoding backends are supported:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>FFmpeg with NVENC (default): Uses FFmpeg&apos;s Vulkan-CUDA hwaccel pipeline</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Direct NVENC (compile with -DNVENC_ENCODER): Uses NVENC directly without FFmpeg </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
